1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
这碗汤，不冒一丝热气
This soup shows no steam

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
却能把生肉片烫熟
Yet it cooks raw meat

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
秘密在汤面那层油
The secret: a layer of oil

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,700
鸡油封住热气，像盖子
Chicken fat seals the heat like a lid

5
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,900
汤心，滚烫近百度
Underneath, near boiling hot

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,000
上桌的顺序有讲究
The order you add things matters

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,200
先下生肉片，几秒变白
Raw slices first — white in seconds

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,400
再下配菜，最后米线
Then greens, then the rice noodles

9
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,500
这碗来自云南蒙自
This bowl comes from Mengzi, Yunnan

10
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,700
三百年，云南名吃之首
300 years, Yunnan's most famous

11
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,900
先下肉，还是先下米线？
Meat first, or noodles first?

12
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,200
下集：给鸭子吹口气，才有脆皮
Next: blow air in — for crispy skin
